# Website Analysis: frawo-tech.de

## Checklist
- [x] Visual Audit (Desktop)
    - [x] Header/Navigation
    - [x] Hero Section
    - [x] Expertise/Services Section
    - [x] Footer (Found missing)
- [x] Visual Audit (Mobile)
- [ ] Typography & Spacing
- [ ] Color Contrast & Accessibility
- [ ] Performance & Loading
- [x] Responsive Design Issues

## Findings
- **Branding/Logo:**
    - [ ] Odoo logo in top left is a placeholder/template default.
- **Navigation:**
    - [ ] Sparse navigation (only one dropdown).
    - [ ] No traditional footer with legal links (Impressum, Datenschutz).
- **Hero Section:**
    - [ ] Checkmark text below buttons has extremely low contrast and is too small.
    - [ ] "UNSERE LEISTUNGEN" button is hard to see (thin border on dark bg).
- **Responsive Issues (Mobile 375px):**
    - [ ] "Unsere Expertise" cards are in 2 columns, making text unreadable/cramped.
    - [ ] "Unsere Kunden" grid is completely broken; text overflows and overlaps.
    - [ ] Horizontal scroll might be present due to overflowing elements.
- **Functional/Visual Errors:**
    - [ ] "FRAWO FUNK" bar stuck on "Connecting..." (Console error: `net::ERR_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED` for `funk.frawo-tech.de`).
- **Layout/Consistency:**
    - [ ] "REFERENZEN" (all caps) vs "Unsere Kunden" (title case).
    - [ ] Card heights and text alignment in client section are inconsistent.
